	"Family": "Parallel corpora",
      "Description": "These corpora are a collection containing web texts and were built by crawling national internet top-level domains and by extending the crawl dynamically to other domains as well.\nAll the crawling process was carried out by the <a href=\"https://github.com/macocu/MaCoCu-crawler\">MaCoCu crawler</a>. Websites containing documents in both target languages were identified and processed using the tool <a href=\"https://github.com/bitextor/bitextor\">Bitextor</a>. Document and segment alignment as implemented in Bitextor were carried out, and <a href=\"https://github.com/bitextor/bifixer\">Bifixer</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/bitextor/bicleaner-ai\">BicleanerAI</a> were used for fixing, cleaning, and deduplicating the final version of the corpus.\n The corpora are available for download from the Slovenian repository CLARIN.SI.",
